      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PRINCE OF KHATUN (3) continued his march through the grades with a tough neck win in BM68 company fresh up here 2 weeks ago. He carries 2.5kg less this time and should have no trouble taking out a race at this level as well. On top. IN THE OCEAN (1) has a terrific record here over the trip, and he has not missed a cheque in 5 starts fresh up in the past, including 2 wins. Hard to beat. ZANY GIRL (4) has not won for some time but was tackling some good fields as a 3YO last season and was not disgraced in any of them. She flashed home late fresh up here 3 weeks ago when finishing second and can go one better in this. GLORY MISSION (6) is a talented and lightly tried 6YO gelding who made it 2 wins from as many starts this prep with a big win over the third pick in the same race, and he will drop 2kg for this assignment. The hat-trick beckons. GEORGARONI (5) made plenty of progress last season, and he is unbeaten in 2 starts fresh up in the past. Follow any market confidence.",
